# SPA fallback, for a host that reads `_redirects` rather than `netlify.toml`.
#
# Without it every deep link 404s — a bookmarked case URL, and every link a caseworker
# pastes to a colleague. 200 rather than 301: the shell is SERVED at the requested path,
# so the router sees the real URL and the address bar keeps it.
/*    /index.html   200
